OL,3,A'I kept seeing people who'd been shot':
OL,4,ABritish tourist describes scene after
OL,5,Adeadly Krakow attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvestigations continue after six
OL,8,Fpeople were killed in a shooting in
OL,9,FKrakow's market square - here's a
OL,10,Ftimeline of what happened
OL,12,FSixteen more were injured, including
OL,13,Ftwo police officers, five foreign
OL,14,Fnationals and the suspect. Two have now
OL,15,Fleft hospital and others are in stable
OL,16,Fcondition, police say
OL,18,FThree other bodies were found at the
OL,19,Fsuspect's home, and were later
OL,20,Fidentified as the man's parents and
OL,21,Fsister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
