OL,3,A'I kept seeing people who'd been shot':
OL,4,ABritish tourist describes scene after
OL,5,Adeadly Krakow attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FEyewitness Tom Brook, from West
OL,8,FYorkshire in England, tells the BBC he
OL,9,F"kept seeing people who'd been shot" in
OL,10,Fthe aftermath of the attack; Ruby
OL,11,FWarren, who lives in London, describes
OL,12,Fhearing gunshots: "I yelled at my
OL,13,Ffriends to run and we all sprinted for
OL,14,Four lives"
OL,16,FThe Krakow branch of Poland's National
OL,17,FProsecutor's Office says the shooting
OL,18,Fin the city centre constitutes "a
OL,19,Fterrorist offence"
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
